__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# 🔴 THIS REPO IS PUBLIC AND IT IS BINARIES AND NOTES ONLY.
#
# 2026-09-08: `git add -A` swept two files pulled off the partner's machine
# into a published commit - a conditioning CSV and a /logstatus dump. Their
# contents were harmless, which was luck, not process. A full flash dump or a
# /status JSON is neither: NVS carries the owner's WiFi password and their
# load-cell calibration.
#
# Machine data is captured into ps3000/_dumps/, which is ignored there. Nothing
# pulled off a machine belongs here, ever.
*.csv
*.bin.gz
status_*.json
logstatus_*.txt
cond_*.csv
creep_*.csv
partner_*.bin
_dumps/

# The releases themselves are tracked deliberately - do not let a broad *.bin
# rule near this repo. Publishing a release means committing four .bin files.
